    "material": "llama:entity_multitexture",
    "contract": "USE_MULTITEXTURE samples three textures on the same normalized UV. RGB first interpolates base toward texture1 by texture1 alpha, then toward texture2 by texture2 alpha; base alpha is retained. Llama has no ALPHA_TEST, COLOR_SECOND_TEXTURE or blending. Near-version installed runtime witness; pinned controller/texture sources identify the current vanilla route."
  },
